        "type": "string",
        "enum": [
          "active",
          "mitigated",
          "false_positive",
          "out_of_scope",
          "risk_accepted",
          "under_review"
        ],
        "title": "FindingStatus",
        "description": "Finding lifecycle status. Labels match ``core.finding_status``.\n\nKata deliberately uses a single status enum (plus a ``verified`` flag and a\n``duplicate_of`` reference) instead of DefectDojo's independent booleans, so that\ninvalid state combinations become unrepresentable. See ADR-0002."
      },
